 "remarks": "Stylish SoNo Living! Completely refreshed and move-in ready, this chic corner unit delivers modern style, smart technology, and an unbeatable location. Enjoy a beautifully updated kitchen with new cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and sleek granite countertops/backsplash, an inviting open living space with an electric fireplace, and upscale modern finishes throughout. Private en-suite bedroom and updated bathroom with ceiling fan, automatic blackout shades, and walk-in closet. Soaring 10' ceilings and oversized windows create a bright, airy vibe. New washer and dryer, in unit. Enjoy a fitness center, attached garage parking, a bike storage room, a lower level storage unit, and pet-friendly living. Just steps from SoNo's vibrant restaurants, boutiques, nightlife, waterfront attractions, and Metro-North. Your perfect SoNo lifestyle starts here!",
